00:24:25.640 --> 00:24:28.080
Do you like roses?

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.020
It's filled with the scent of roses in the oxygen capsule.

00:24:32.440 --> 00:24:41.750
The result of the artificial uterus that my parents did for me.

00:24:41.770 --> 00:24:45.080
