That's right, Mr. Goggle.

00:26:33.740 --> 00:26:36.660
I'll send this guy to the science department and make him.

00:26:36.940 --> 00:26:37.380
Yes sir!

00:27:21.280 --> 00:27:23.650
It's a high-mobility elevator.

00:27:24.030 --> 00:27:25.770
