00:29:03.160 --> 00:29:04.440
That's the other answer.

00:29:04.740 --> 00:29:08.350
The dark scientist tried to make it desperately to protect their lives.

00:29:09.630 --> 00:29:11.920
A vaccine to destroy the virus.

00:29:12.040 --> 00:29:14.570
