00:31:35.980 --> 00:31:37.160
Let go of Masuda Remi.

00:31:38.050 --> 00:31:39.990
You're still alive.

00:31:40.960 --> 00:31:44.200
I'm Sionji Shuzo, president of the Sionji Medical Organization Group.

00:31:45.060 --> 00:31:46.920
I'm a great weapon.

00:31:47.460 --> 00:31:52.000
But I don't have the right to use a patient who sleeps in a sleeping capsule for illegal biological experiments.

00:31:53.280 --> 00:31:57.340
The power of the old man.

00:32:01.790 --> 00:32:03.390
No one can kill me.

00:32:06.220 --> 00:32:11.320
