00:32:34.030 --> 00:32:34.270
Thank you.

00:33:04.668 --> 00:33:05.668
Thank you.

00:33:46.348 --> 00:33:48.348
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:35:00.800 --> 00:35:08.630
I told you. No one can kill me. I will continue to live forever.

00:35:09.670 --> 00:35:12.340
Forever? Don't say that.

00:35:13.180 --> 00:35:17.850
Everything in this universe has a beginning and an end.

00:35:18.210 --> 00:35:20.560
There is no such thing as eternity.

00:35:21.720 --> 00:35:24.060
If there is something that will not disappear forever...

00:36:01.600 --> 00:36:01.840
Thank you.

00:36:31.052 --> 00:36:32.052
Me too.

00:36:32.300 --> 00:36:33.000
Die!

00:36:50.444 --> 00:36:51.204
A bad dream

00:36:51.276 --> 00:36:51.776
It's over.

00:38:04.860 --> 00:38:08.840
Strangely, thousands of years ago, the light of the stars shone.

00:38:08.840 --> 00:38:10.610
Now, it reaches us.

00:38:12.050 --> 00:38:15.530
But the light of the stars is ours.

00:38:16.050 --> 00:38:22.240
A dark, lonely journey.

00:38:30.220 --> 00:38:32.220
Thank you for watching.

00:38:32.908 --> 00:38:34.908
The light of the stars
